  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-09-25T23:26:13.571Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have not published this technique via my account, nor have I informed anyone of details.\n\nA trivial security flaw allows crashing of a driver in an easily controlled way that is difficult to detect if used subtly.\n\nI propose a partial solution of using statistical analysis of abnormally disconnected clients, to determine which avatars or users are causing the issue. Exploiting users can then be banned manually, and avatars blacklisted automatically.",
